{"t":"NKE","made":"2026-11-25 03:52","name":"NIKE, Inc.","ko":"나이키","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Footwear & Accessories","employees":73000,"hq":"Beaverton, OR, United States","website":"https://www.nike.com","summary_en":"NIKE, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, designs, develops, markets, and sells athletic footwear, apparel, equipment, accessories, and services for men, women, and kids in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Greater China, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. The company offers its products under the NIKE, Jordan, Converse, Jumpman, Chuck Taylor, All Star, One Star, Star Chevron, and Jack Purcell trademarks. It also provides a line of performance equipment and accessories, including bags, socks, sport balls, eyewear, timepieces, digital devices, bats, gloves, protective equipment, and other equipment for sports activities; and sports apparel, as well as sells products to wholesale customers and directly to consumers through NIKE Direct operations; distributes and licenses casual sneakers, apparel, and accessories; and markets apparel with licensed college and professional team and league logos. In addition, the company offers consumer services and experiences, including sport focused events and activations; fitness and activity apps; sport, fitness, and wellness content; and digital services and features in retail stores. It sells its products to footwear stores; sporting goods stores; athletic specialty stores; department stores; skate, tennis, and golf shops; and other wholesale accounts through NIKE-owned retail stores, independent distributors, licensees, sales representatives, and digital platforms. The company was formerly known as Blue Ribbon Sports, Inc. and changed its name to NIKE, Inc. in May 1971. NIKE, Inc. was founded in 1964 and is headquartered in Beaverton, Oregon.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"NIKE, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 북미, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카, 중화권, 아시아 태평양 및 라틴 아메리카 지역의 남성, 여성 및 어린이를 위한 운동화, 의류, 장비, 액세서리 및 서비스를 디자인, 개발, 마케팅 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 NIKE, Jordan, Converse, Jumpman, Chuck Taylor, All Star, One Star, Star Chevron 및 Jack Purcell 상표로 제품을 제공합니다. 또한 가방, 양말, 스포츠 공, 안경, 시계, 디지털 장치, 배트, 장갑, 보호 장비 및 기타 스포츠 활동 장비를 포함한 일련의 성능 장비 및 액세서리를 제공합니다. 스포츠 의류 및 도매 고객에게 제품을 판매할 뿐만 아니라 NIKE Direct 운영을 통해 소비자에게 직접 판매합니다. 캐주얼 운동화, 의류, 액세서리를 배포하고 라이선스를 부여합니다. 허가받은 대학 및 전문 팀과 리그 로고가 있는 의류를 판매합니다. 또한 회사는 스포츠 중심 이벤트 및 활동을 포함하여 소비자 서비스와 경험을 제공합니다. 피트니스 및 활동 앱; 스포츠, 피트니스, 웰니스 콘텐츠; 소매점의 디지털 서비스 및 기능. 신발 매장에 제품을 판매합니다. 스포츠 용품점; 운동 전문점; 백화점; 스케이트, 테니스, 골프 상점; NIKE 소유 소매점, 독립 유통업체, 라이센스 사용자, 판매 담당자 및 디지털 플랫폼을 통한 기타 도매 계정. 이 회사는 이전에 Blue Ribbon Sports, Inc.로 알려졌으며 1971년 5월에 NIKE, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. NIKE, Inc.는 1964년에 설립되었으며 오리건주 비버턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":35.91,"mcap":53337440256.0,"pe":17.264423,"fpe":26.13594,"peg":2.8517,"ps":1.1622636,"pb":3.498977,"ev_ebitda":10.812,"div":4.86,"beta":1.031,"hi52":69.14,"lo52":31.97},"fin":{"rev":45890998272.0,"rev_g":-0.043,"eps_g":-0.021,"gross":0.43407002,"op":0.09028,"net":0.0674,"roe":0.21563,"fcf":1766875008.0,"cash":8368000000.0,"debt":11125000192.0,"de":73.095,"eps":2.08,"feps":1.37397},"own":{"short":0.097200006,"inst":0.83556,"insider":0.01974},"analyst":{"n":38,"mean":36.5,"median":34.4,"high":60.0,"low":19.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.93182,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":25,"sell":6,"strongSell":3},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":25,"sell":5,"strongSell":3},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":9,"hold":26,"sell":3,"strongSell":3},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":10,"hold":25,"sell":1,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":38.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":39.0,"prior